{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X 的音乐感受描写明显不如 Y 细腻，尤其缺少按乐句出现的具体音色、节奏、力度和情绪变化，部分音乐转折因此显得比较概括。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"平\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"X 的左右分栏让人物叙事和音乐感受各有位置，观众可以快速扫读，不必在大量交替信息之间反复切换；连续的叙事句也更容易跟住人物从离开、怀念、动摇到接纳的完整变化。Y 的关键词高亮和分时出现的音乐细节确实更有表现力，尤其在细腻度上明显胜出，但部分短时段的信息密度过高，容易让观众忙于读字而顾不上听音乐。综合实际观看体验，我选 X。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e8259dc1-6bd6-4768-9498-42fcfafa6003", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163727747980Z", "elapsed_seconds": 125.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:39:32.780048+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "148acafd9286706e7f20a52c2ab5f50702a1600c4c5ae7530d44cfa72e340fb9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734